    "progressSummary": "COMPLETE: PR #34998, verified 0 sorry/0 axiom. Product formula + prime-power + coprime multiplicativity + sharpness. Answers OQ-06 follow-up.",
    "builtItems": [
      "card_divisors_eq_prod in Proofs/SumOfDivisorsOQ06OQ01.lean:37",
      "card_divisors_prime_pow :43, card_divisors_prime :48",
      "card_divisors_coprime_mul :55 (re-export of Nat.Coprime.card_divisors_mul)",
      "card_divisors_mul_ne_of_not_coprime :64, not_coprime_two_two :68 (sharpness)"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "τ(n)=∏(vₚ(n)+1) is Nat.card_divisors up to rewriting the Finsupp.prod index set to primeFactors via Nat.support_factorization (definitional).",
      "τ(pᵃ)=a+1 follows from Nat.divisors_prime_pow (divisors of pᵃ = image of range(a+1)) + Finset.card_map + Finset.card_range.",
      "Sharpness: τ is multiplicative but NOT completely multiplicative — τ(4)=3≠4=τ(2)², provable by kernel `decide` on m=n=2; coprimality hypothesis in card_divisors_mul is necessary."
    ],
    "mathlibGaps": [
      "Mathlib states card_divisors only in Finsupp.prod form and has no direct τ(pᵃ)=a+1 lemma nor a stated 'not completely multiplicative' witness for τ."
    ],
